# WP-SETTINGS-UI (UE World Settings > World Partition Setup + the UHLODLayer editor + actor Details > World Partition):
# the World Partition panel edits the world's HLOD layers (New/Rename/Delete refused while named, Type, Parent,
# Spatially Loaded + Cell size + Loading range, MeshSimplify's Triangles kept) and ChunkRegionSize; the Details panel
# shows a World Partition section for every entity of a partitioned world - Is Spatially Loaded, Runtime Grid,
# HLOD Layer (new per-entity override, WP format v4, ECS::HLODLayerComponent, read by Rules::CellHLODParts) and Data
# Layers, plus the cell its composite lands in (Rules::CellStem). Every edit is one undo step.
# WP_Protocol states layers HLOD_Main (spatial, parent HLOD_Main_Far), HLOD_Main_Far, HLOD_Foliage, HLOD_Landscape -
# the brief's "Near" is HLOD_Main here; its grid "MainGrid" is "Main".
# The house: 1000 is the first external record of WP_Protocol; lead - if it is not a Main-grid building, take any
# building's id from the Outliner (Details > World Partition must read Grid Main).
# Lead: if `set` does not create a missing component, add it first (Details > Add Component > HLOD Layer, or the
# DesertCtl add-component form) - the field is HLODLayerData.Layer; the Details row itself adds it.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано run Scene "World Partition: Load All"
Когда set world WorldPartition.HLODLayers [{"Name":"HLOD_Main","Type":"Instancing","ParentLayer":"HLOD_Main_Far","CellSize":51200,"LoadingRange":102400},{"Name":"HLOD_Main_Far","Type":"MeshMerge"},{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","Type":"Instancing"},{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","Type":"Instancing"},{"Name":"Far2","Type":"MeshSimplify","SimplifyTrianglePercent":0.5}]
Когда set world WorldPartition.HLODLayers [{"Name":"HLOD_Main","Type":"Instancing","ParentLayer":"Far2","CellSize":51200,"LoadingRange":102400},{"Name":"HLOD_Main_Far","Type":"MeshMerge"},{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","Type":"Instancing"},{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","Type":"Instancing"},{"Name":"Far2","Type":"MeshSimplify","SimplifyTrianglePercent":0.5}]
Когда select 1000
Когда set 1000 HLODLayerData.Layer "Far2"
Тогда wpui_layers панель World Partition, раздел HLOD layers: строка Far2 (Type MeshSimplify, Triangles kept 50.0 %, Parent None, Spatially Loaded снят), у HLOD_Main Parent = Far2, Used by у Far2: "0 grid(s), 1 layer(s) as Parent, 1 entity"; раздел Chunked packaging отмечен, Chunk region 100000. Details дома 1000 - раздел World Partition: Is Spatially Loaded отмечен, Runtime Grid "Main (main grid)", HLOD Layer Far2, Data Layers "No layer", Cell G0_L0_<x>_<z> - grid Main, level 0, cell 25 m
Когда run Action "Undo"
Тогда wpui_undo Details дома: HLOD Layer "Grid's layer (HLOD_Main)"; панель как в wpui_layers (слой и Parent - отдельные шаги истории)
Когда run Action "Redo"
Тогда wpui_redo то же, что wpui_layers: HLOD Layer Far2, ячейка та же
Когда run Action "Undo"
Когда run Action "Undo"
Когда run Action "Undo"
Тогда wpui_restored раздел HLOD layers без Far2, у HLOD_Main Parent = HLOD_Main_Far; Details дома: HLOD Layer "Grid's layer (HLOD_Main)"; мир как в начале (сцену не сохранять)
